OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment could clean up huge
OL,4,Aillegal waste dump
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has said the government could
OL,7,Fclean up one of the country's largest
OL,8,Fillegal waste sites which has been
OL,9,Fgiving off a "foul" stink for almost a
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FThe field just off junction 4 of the
OL,13,FM57 in Kirkby, Knowsley, Merseyside,
OL,14,Fcontains about 30,000 tonnes of heavy
OL,15,Fduty rubbish.
OL,17,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,18,F(LDRS) understands none of the rubbish
OL,19,Fhas been removed from the site since it
OL,20,Fwas discovered in late 2025.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
